# Captain Kirk, Boldly Going's second trigger is the same fetch whenever he attacks. Wheel of Fortune empties both hands on turn 1, so a
# Forest and a Plains are in Bot1's graveyard; Kirk is cast on turn 3, declines the library search, and must take a basic land from the
# public graveyard instead (the Forest), then attacks on turn 5 and takes the Plains. Neither search touched the library, so neither
# shuffled it: its order is exactly what the draws left.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Wheel of Fortune
Forest
